<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to drain 2.614 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to drain 2.614 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned the first of three auctions in which it sought to drain 2.614 billion pesos from the secondary market Monday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered or assigned as follows:</p>
<p>     AMOUNT     TERM     AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>	900 mln  11 days   24.75 pct</p>
<p>    1.300 bln   4 days</p>
<p>	414 mln   1 day</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
